# RESTLESS: a weapon torch lets out a wheel of three, seeker, ember and
# scatter, turning slowly. Touch one to take it and the rest go. The one
# he already holds is a gold jar instead.
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
cheat wheel 200 132
wait 20
expect items_13 == 3
expect items_3 == 0
cheat clearitems
cheat weapon 2
cheat wheel 200 132
wait 20
expect items_13 == 2
expect items_3 == 1
hold RIGHT 160
waituntil items == 0 200
expect weapon != 2
